    "level" : "Info",
    "category" : "BestPractice",
    "subCategory" : null,
    "title" : "Avoid Useless Use of 'cat' in Pipelines",
    "description" : "Detects and discourages unnecessary use of 'cat' command in pipelines where input redirection can be used instead.",
    "explanation" : "## useless-cat\nUseless call to 'cat' in a pipeline. Use '<' and '>' for any command to read from a file or write to a file.",
