    "description" : "Detects when stacktrace information is displayed in environments other than development.",
    "explanation" : "## stacktrace-disclosure\nStacktrace information is displayed in a non-Development environment. Accidentally disclosing sensitive stack trace information in a production environment aids an attacker in reconnaissance and information gathering.",
