    "title" : "Avoid Enabling DTD Parsing with XmlReaderSettings in Public Methods",
    "description" : "Detects XmlReaderSettings configured with DtdProcessing.Parse used on XmlReader instances that handle string arguments from public methods, which may lead to XML External Entity (XXE) injection vulnerabilities.",
    "explanation" : "## xmldocument-unsafe-parser-override\nXmlReaderSettings found with DtdProcessing.Parse on an XmlReader handling a string argument from a public method. Enabling Document Type Definition (DTD) parsing may cause XML External Entity (XXE) injection if supplied with user-controllable data.",
