    "title" : "Prefer COPY over ADD in Dockerfiles",
    "description" : "Enforces using the COPY command instead of ADD in Dockerfiles to avoid unintended side effects and security risks.",
    "explanation" : "## prefer-copy-over-add\nThe ADD command will accept and include files from a URL and automatically extract archives. This potentially exposes the container to a man-in-the-middle attack or other attacks if a malicious actor can tamper with the source archive. Since ADD can have this and other unexpected side effects, the use of the more explicit COPY command is preferred.",
