    "description" : "This rule enforces not using 'sudo' commands inside Dockerfiles.",
    "explanation" : "## no-sudo-in-dockerfile\nAvoid using sudo in Dockerfiles. Running processes as a non-root user can help  reduce the potential impact of configuration errors and security vulnerabilities.",
    "enabled" : true,
    "timeToFix" : 5,
    "parameters" : [
    ],
