    "category" : "Security",
    "subCategory" : "XSS",
    "title" : "Enforce HttpOnly Flag on Session Cookies",
    "description" : "Detects session cookies that are missing the 'HttpOnly' flag to prevent client-side scripts from accessing them.",
    "explanation" : "## session-cookie-missing-httponly\nA session cookie was detected without setting the 'HttpOnly' flag. The 'HttpOnly' flag for cookies instructs the browser to forbid client-side scripts from reading the cookie which mitigates XSS attacks. Set the 'HttpOnly' flag by setting 'HttpOnly' to 'true' in the Options struct.",
