    "subCategory" : "SQLInjection",
    "title" : "Avoid Dangerous GORM Methods Usage",
    "description" : "Detects usage of dangerous GORM methods that do not escape inputs, potentially leading to SQL injection if user-controlled data is used.",
    "explanation" : "## gorm-dangerous-method-usage\nDetected usage of dangerous method $METHOD which does not escape inputs (see link in references). If the argument is user-controlled, this can lead to SQL injection. When using $METHOD function, do not trust user-submitted data and only allow approved list of input (possibly, use an allowlist approach).",
