    "title" : "Avoid allowing plaintext traffic in Network Security Config",
    "description" : "Detects when the Android Network Security Config is set to allow non-encrypted (plaintext) network connections.",
    "explanation" : "## nsc-allows-plaintext-traffic\nThe Network Security Config is set to allow non-encrypted connections. Evaluate if this is necessary for your app, and disable it if appropriate. (To hide this warning, set `xmlns:tools=\"http://schemas.android.com/tools\" tools:ignore=\"InsecureBaseConfiguration\"` as parameters to your `<network-security-config>`)",
