    "category" : "Security",
    "subCategory" : "XSS",
    "title" : "Avoid JSP Scriptlets",
    "description" : "Detects usage of JSP scriptlets which are considered insecure and bad practice.",
    "explanation" : "## no-scriptlets\nJSP scriptlet detected. Scriptlets are difficult to use securely and are considered bad practice. See https://stackoverflow.com/a/3180202. Instead, consider migrating to JSF or using the Expression Language '${...}' with the escapeXml function in your JSP files.",
