    "description" : "Detects usage of window.postMessage() where the target origin is set to '*', which allows any origin to receive the message.",
    "explanation" : "## wildcard-postmessage-configuration\nThe target origin of the window.postMessage() API is set to \"*\". This could allow for information disclosure due to the possibility of any origin allowed to receive the message.",
