    "title" : "Enforce setting null=True on unique text fields with blank=True",
    "description" : "Ensures that if a Django text field has unique=True and blank=True, it must also have null=True to prevent unique constraint violations.",
    "explanation" : "## string-field-must-set-null-true\nIf a text field declares unique=True and blank=True, null=True must also be set to avoid unique constraint violations when saving multiple objects with blank values.",
    "enabled" : false,
