    "explanation" : "## string-is-comparison\nFound string comparison using 'is' operator. The 'is' operator is for reference equality, not value equality, and therefore should not be used to compare strings. For more information, see https://github.com/satwikkansal/wtfpython#-how-not-to-use-is-operator\"",
