    "explanation" : "## aiopg-sqli\nDetected string concatenation with a non-literal variable in an aiopg Python SQL statement. This could lead to SQL injection if the variable is user-controlled and not properly sanitized. In order to prevent SQL injection, use parameterized queries instead. You can create parameterized queries like so: 'cur.execute(\"SELECT %s FROM table\", (user_value,))'.",
