    "id" : "python.sqlalchemy.security.audit.avoid-sqlalchemy-text.avoid-sqlalchemy-text",
    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "Security",
    "subCategory" : "SQLInjection",
    "title" : "Avoid Using sqlalchemy.text",
    "description" : "This rule detects usage of sqlalchemy.text which passes raw SQL statements to the database without usual SQL injection protections.",
    "explanation" : "## avoid-sqlalchemy-text\nsqlalchemy.text passes the constructed SQL statement to the database mostly unchanged. This means that the usual SQL injection protections are not applied and this function is vulnerable to SQL injection if user input can reach here. Use normal SQLAlchemy operators (such as or_, and_, etc.) to construct SQL.",
