    "title" : "Avoid Timing Attack Vulnerabilities in String Comparisons",
    "description" : "Detects string comparisons using '===', '!==', '!=', and '==' operators which are vulnerable to timing attacks in JavaScript.",
    "explanation" : "## rules_lgpl_javascript_crypto_rule-node-timing-attack\n'String comparisons using ''==='', ''!=='', ''!='' and ''=='' is vulnerable to timing attacks. More info: https://snyk.io/blog/node-js-timing-attack-ccc-ctf/'",
