    "title" : "Avoid Checking indexOf Result Greater Than 0",
    "description" : "Detects Scala code that checks if the result of indexOf is greater than 0, which ignores the first element and is likely a bug.",
    "explanation" : "## positive-number-index-of\nFlags scala code that look for values that are greater than 0. This ignores the first element, which is most likely a bug. Instead, use indexOf with -1. If the intent is to check the inclusion of a value, use the contains method instead.",
