    "title" : "Avoid Redundant runtime and handler Fields with AWS Lambda Image Package Type",
    "description" : "Ensures that when using AWS Lambda with package_type set to \"Image\", the redundant fields `runtime` and `handler` are not specified, as they are unnecessary and cause errors.",
    "explanation" : "## lambda-redundant-field-with-image\nWhen using the AWS Lambda \"Image\" package_type, `runtime` and `handler` are not necessary for Lambda to understand how to run the code. These are built into the container image. Including `runtime` or `handler` with an \"Image\" `package_type` will result in an error on `terraform apply`. Remove these redundant fields.",
