    "level" : "High",
    "category" : "Security",
    "subCategory" : "InsecureStorage",
    "title" : "Enforce AWS SSM Document Logging with Encryption",
    "description" : "Ensures that AWS Systems Manager (SSM) document logs are enabled and encrypted using AWS KMS to protect sensitive operational data.",
    "explanation" : "## aws-ssm-document-logging-issues\nThe AWS SSM logs are unencrypted or disabled. Please enable logs and use AWS KMS encryption key to protect SSM logs. To create your own, create a aws_kms_key resource or use the ARN string of a key in your account.",
