    "explanation" : "## changes-with-when-never\nThis Gitlab CI YAML will never run on default branches due to a `changes` rule with `when:never`. To fix this, make sure the triggering event is a push event. You can do this with `if: '$CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == \"push\"'`. See https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/yaml/index.html#ruleschanges",
