    "explanation" : "## exposing-docker-socket-hostpath\nExposing host's Docker socket to containers via a volume. The owner of this socket is root. Giving someone access to it is equivalent to giving unrestricted root access to your host. Remove 'docker.sock' from hostpath to prevent this.",
